// Every fact carries the time it was established; `Held(e) For d` holds when `e` holds and has held for at least `d` (Law 7: a condition over the stamp, never an event).
Fact p Identified by P.
+p(P).
?Held(p(P)) For 0.
?!Held(p(P)) For 1.
@ 3.
?Held(p(P)) For 3.
?!Held(p(P)) For 4.
tick.
?Held(p(P)) For 4.
-p(P).
?!Held(p(P)) For 0.
